> \]
> Substitution of
> \(\tau(k)=\eta^{-Q(m(k))}\) proves the pinned
> \(\tau\)-ratio.
>
> The displayed formula uses the binary-carry supplier fact essentially. No analogous linear-in-\(w_2\) formula is asserted for \(w_2>1\).

Replace the closing A2 scope sentence

